---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="About - LLM Deals">
  <div class="hero">
    <div class="eyebrow">About</div>
    <h1>How it works</h1>
    <p class="lead">LLM Deals provides verified pricing data for AI models, helping you find the best value.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="content">
    <section class="section">
      <h2>Verified Pricing</h2>
      <p>All pricing data is collected directly from official provider websites and documentation. We verify each price point against official sources before including it in our database.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <h2>Deal Analysis</h2>
      <p>We analyze subscription deals, credits, and promotions to calculate effective token prices. This means you can compare deals across different pricing models - from pay-as-you-go to subscription credits.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <h2>OpenCode Go Integration</h2>
      <p>LLM Deals integrates with OpenCode Go to provide real-time pricing for their managed API. OpenCode Go offers a $10/month subscription with $60 of included usage across multiple AI models.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <h2>Data Freshness</h2>
      <p>We regularly check provider websites for pricing updates. Each data point includes when it was last verified, so you know how current the information is.</p>
    </section>
  </div>

  <style>
    .content {
      max-width: 800px;
    }

    .section {
      margin-bottom: 48px;
    }

    h2 {
      font-size: 24px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      color: var(--text);
    }

    p {
      color: var(--text-muted);
      line-height: 1.7;
      font-size: 16px;
    }
  </style>
</Base>
